    "title": "MachineSignal Lead Opportunity Score API",
    "short_title": "MachineSignal",
    "one_liner": "Machine-readable lead opportunity scoring and spend-control API for CRMs, AI agents, RevOps workflows and software platforms.",
    "short_description": "MachineSignal helps automated systems decide which business domains deserve more sales, CRM or enrichment budget.",
    "long_description": "MachineSignal is a machine-first sales intelligence API for CRMs, AI agents, RevOps workflows and software platforms. The API lets a customer machine create a limited sandbox key, read a product catalog, score domains, request Target Discovery when it has no list, buy Deep Analysis only when a score justifies it, and buy Action Pack only after Deep Analysis confirms the gates. The product is built around budget control: invalid, duplicate or non-analyzable records do not consume credits, and Action Pack returns CRM-ready JSON instead of sending external outreach. Latest bounded beta evidence proves the complete machine-buyer sequence under controlled credits: score, Deep Analysis and gated Action Pack, with no real payment or external outreach.",
    "machine_buyer_value": [
      "find targets for a declared commercial objective",
      "prioritize a list before spending enrichment, campaign, CRM or agent budget",
      "buy Deep Analysis only when a score justifies controlled spend",
      "buy Action Pack only after Deep Analysis confirms the action gate",
      "retrieve CRM-ready and workflow-ready JSON deliveries"
    ]
  },
